5. **Local Environment**:
   - Make sure that your local environment is set up correctly with all required dependencies installed as specified in your project.

6. **Testing in Isolation**:
   - Isolate tests to ensure they can run independently without depending on other tests.

7. **Check Browser Compatibility**:
