```pseudocode
ROUTE '/register':
    IF request.method IS GET
        RENDER register.html PAGE with registration form
    ELSE IF request.method IS POST
        CALL user_manager.register(username, password)
        IF registration is SUCCESSFUL
            REDIRECT to '/login'
        ELSE
            RETURN ERROR message
        ENDIF
    ENDIF
END ROUTE
```
**Libraries Used:**
- `Flask`: As earlier, it provides route management and request handling.

---

